J. Ascher (1829–1869)
 

Piano
1890s?
Song

Transcribed for the pianoforte by Joseph Ascher
Sydney: Nicholson &amp; Co., (1890s)
Public Domain
Mutopia-2015/01/16-449
Stan Sanderson
physinfoman@ameritech.net

<p>This piece, an expansion of Ascher's popular "Alice" tune, is, I believe, typical of the repertory of the parlor performer. I suspect it exists on a piano roll somewhere.</p><p>The original is very dim; the transcription was as true as possible; corrections are welcome.</p>
