http://pobox.com/~jeff.covey/
<p>The downloads include both the score and the individual instrument files.</p><p>Hans Hokke has made several improved MIDI (audio) files for this piece:</p><ul><li><a href="../ftp/BachJS/BWV1068/bach-air/bach-air-jlh-35.mid">String quartet, 35 beats per minute</a></li><li><a href="../ftp/BachJS/BWV1068/bach-air/bach-air-jlh-70.mid">String quartet, 70 beats per minute</a></li><li><a href="../ftp/BachJS/BWV1068/bach-air/bach-air-jlh-40-organ.mid">Organ, 40 beats per minute</a></li></ul><p>(Of course, Bach played the organ himself, so he may have heard the Air played in a similar setting to the third version.)</p>
