<p>George Loder's arrangement is rather different from the original song on which it is based: "The Boatman Dance" (also called "Dance, Boatman, Dance") by Daniel Emmett. The melody is essentially the same, but the words come from a poem by George P Morris.</p><p>The three part chorus is optional.</p>
