<p>Words for this song include:</p><ul><li>Isaac Watt's "Jesus shall reign where'er the sun"</li><li>John S B Monsell's "Fight the Good Fight"</li></ul><p>This version of the tune is taken from a variety of sources including:</p><ul><li>"A Collection of Hymns for the People known as Methodists" 1831 (where it is in E, the note values are halved, and the base harmony is "straight" in bar 14)</li><li>"Methodist Hymn Book with Tunes" (where note values are as in this edition, the key is E flat, and there are more passing-notes in the alto part than shown here)</li><li>The Anglican Hymn Book of 1965, which has the slightly simpler alto part reproduced here, and is in D.</li></ul>
